CommitDate: Thu Oct 22 07:30:02 2026 -0300

    Preserve Evolution pending operations across savestates
    
    Preserve the three Evolution pending-operation flags required for exact savestate replay.
    
    Extend the tagged savestate format to version 11 and prevent pending operations from executing prematurely while CPU state is being restored.
    
    Restore armed-switch, record-read, and launch-reset state so repeated loads reproduce the saved execution timeline and CPU-visible data.
    
    Add pending-operation boundary, repeated-load, and real T80 regression coverage.

